/-! # The views' accessibility identifiers

Every `Html.identified` in the app names its node here, and the UI journeys (`../Journeys.lean`) name the nodes
they tap and read through the same definitions, so an identifier a journey uses but no view gives is a compile
error, and a search for one finds both sides. The strings are what XCTest and LeanNative's drivers see
(`accessibilityIdentifier`); a few are built from a value (a payment's txid, an account's id). -/

